{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 2, "text": "送第九枝花，", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 240, "w": 226, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "送第九枝花，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 240, "w": 226, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 3, "text": "莪富①送她来。", "bbox_px": {"x": 425, "y": 298, "w": 263, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "莪富①送她来。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 425, "y": 298, "w": 263, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 4, "text": "来求公求婆，", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 370, "w": 225, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "来求公求婆，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 370, "w": 225, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 5, "text": "来桥上跪拜。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 434, "w": 225, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来桥上跪拜。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 434, "w": 225, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 6, "text": "送第十枝花，", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 498, "w": 225, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "送第十枝花，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 498, "w": 225, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 7, "text": "卷衣袖来挤。", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 562, "w": 230, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "卷衣袖来挤。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 562, "w": 230, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 8, "text": "别家她不去，", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 629, "w": 226, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "别家她不去，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 629, "w": 226, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 9, "text": "偏来你家挤。", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 692, "w": 229, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "偏来你家挤。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 692, "w": 229, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 10, "text": "坛师唱到这里，弟子把一棵长约一尺五的小木棍，棍的一端尖上挂着一块也约一尺", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 752, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "坛师唱到这里，弟子把一棵长约一尺五的小木棍，棍的一端尖上挂着一块也约一尺", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 752, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 11, "text": "五的土白布递给坛师。这张挂在小木棍上的土白布是刚从织布机上剪下来的，要求绝对", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 817, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "五的土白布递给坛师。这张挂在小木棍上的土白布是刚从织布机上剪下来的，要求绝对", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 817, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 12, "text": "清洁，俗称“挽花布”。坛师一边念咒语，一边挥动木棍使挂在木棍上的土白布在花筒上", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 877, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "清洁，俗称“挽花布”。坛师一边念咒语，一边挥动木棍使挂在木棍上的土白布在花筒上", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 877, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 13, "text": "来回抹檫着往上提，力图用布把插在花筒里的花拔出来。一次又一次重复，不时一枝枝", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 945, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来回抹檫着往上提，力图用布把插在花筒里的花拔出来。一次又一次重复，不时一枝枝", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 945, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 14, "text": "花被布从花筒里拔出来放进接花盘里。端花盘的人是乡间百里挑一的所谓“命根八字”", "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1006, "w": 1552, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "花被布从花筒里拔出来放进接花盘里。端花盘的人是乡间百里挑一的所谓“命根八字”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1006, "w": 1552, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 15, "text": "最好的人，是主人特意请来的最尊贵的贵客。这在送花仪式中名曰“钩花”。钩花时，坛", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1070, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "最好的人，是主人特意请来的最尊贵的贵客。这在送花仪式中名曰“钩花”。钩花时，坛", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1070, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 16, "text": "师除不停的口念咒语外，还吟咏“挽花歌”，每吟两句，在场人都要齐声和“嗨哟，嗨哟！”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1135, "w": 1552, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "师除不停的口念咒语外，还吟咏“挽花歌”，每吟两句，在场人都要齐声和“嗨哟，嗨哟！”。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1135, "w": 1552, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 17, "text": "挽花歌的歌词：", "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1203, "w": 274, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "挽花歌的歌词：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1203, "w": 274, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 18, "text": "欲拜七许且七君，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1275, "w": 306, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "欲拜七许且七君，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1275, "w": 306, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 19, "text": "挽花父母说原因。", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 1340, "w": 314, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "挽花父母说原因。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 1340, "w": 314, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 20, "text": "众和：嗨哟，嗨哟！（下同，略）", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1400, "w": 515, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "众和：嗨哟，嗨哟！（下同，略）", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1400, "w": 515, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 21, "text": "今日挽花给七许，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1468, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "今日挽花给七许，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1468, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 22, "text": "今朝挽花给主人。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1533, "w": 310, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "今朝挽花给主人。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1533, "w": 310, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 23, "text": "外公外婆送花来，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1597, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "外公外婆送花来，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1597, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 24, "text": "主家拜谢外家恩。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1662, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "主家拜谢外家恩。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1662, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 25, "text": "送男孩或送女孩，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1726, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "送男孩或送女孩，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1726, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 26, "text": "男孩女孩桥上行。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1790, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "男孩女孩桥上行。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1790, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 27, "text": "来一男孩和女孩，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1851, "w": 318, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来一男孩和女孩，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1851, "w": 318, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 28, "text": "你来这家做新人。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1915, "w": 318, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "你来这家做新人。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1915, "w": 318, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 29, "text": "来二男孩和女孩，", "bbox_px": {"x": 434, "y": 1979, "w": 314, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来二男孩和女孩，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 434, "y": 1979, "w": 314, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 30, "text": "你来桥上领人情。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2044, "w": 318, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "你来桥上领人情。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2044, "w": 318, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 31, "text": "这家有钱又有粮，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2107, "w": 318, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这家有钱又有粮，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2107, "w": 318, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 32, "text": "父母娶媳合你心。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2173, "w": 318, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "父母娶媳合你心。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2173, "w": 318, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 33, "text": "这家有牛又有马，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2237, "w": 318, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这家有牛又有马，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2237, "w": 318, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 34, "text": "父母搓绳给你牵。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2300, "w": 318, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "父母搓绳给你牵。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2300, "w": 318, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 399, "line_no": 35, "text": "来继鱼塘在樟下，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2365, "w": 318, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来继鱼塘在樟下，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 2365, "w": 318, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
